WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.583
Step 1: Open Admin → Locations → Edit location → Employer setup, or its location setup checklist. Confirm the location’s legal employer, award coverage and pay period, then press Save settings.

2
00:00:10.583 --> 00:00:24.292
Step 2: Edit employees under Admin → Users → Employment &amp; award. Save dated employment type, birth date, classification and pay arrangement; Automatic award rates calculates the hourly amounts. Choose a rate date to inspect junior birthdays or later employment terms.

3
00:00:24.292 --> 00:00:32.667
Step 3: Review the edition, rule versions and holiday calendars in Award compliance. Inspect roster and timesheet calculation warnings after enabling the location’s settings.

4
00:00:32.667 --> 00:00:38.875
Step 4: Review imported rule updates before activating them; add required review notes on publish or approval.
